## Spring Boot Profile Selection
## dev: HTTP on port 8080 (local development - no SSL)
## prod: HTTPS on port 8443 with Let's Encrypt (EC2 production)
## To override on command line: export SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod
SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=dev

## OpenAI LLM Provider
## API key from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
## Used for chat completions in MaxBot assistant
OPENAI_API_KEY=<YOUR_OPENAI_API_KEY>

## Pinecone Vector Store
## API key from https://app.pinecone.io/
## Stores vector embeddings for RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation)
PINECONE_API_KEY=<YOUR_PINECONE_API_KEY>

## API Authentication Keys
## Generated for internal API endpoints protection
## APP_CHAT_KEY: Used for chat endpoint authentication
## APP_EMBEDDING_KEY: Used for embedding endpoint authentication
APP_CHAT_KEY=<YOUR_CHAT_API_KEY>
APP_EMBEDDING_KEY=<YOUR_EMBEDDING_API_KEY>
